{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23415","headline":"慵不能 · 白居易","name":"慵不能","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"架上非无书，眼慵不能看。\n匣中亦有琴，手慵不能弹。\n腰慵不能带，头慵不能冠。\n午後恣情寝，午时随事餐。\n一餐终日饱，一寝至夜安。\n饥寒亦闲事，况乃不饥寒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}